        "content": "## WorkRadar · Morning brief\nEvery weekday at 8:45 IST: runs ingestion, asks the digest workflow for the AI brief, formats it for Slack and posts it.\n\nNeeds workflows 1 and 2 active. Add a Slack incoming-webhook URL in **Config** to post; without it, the formatted message is shown in the run output.",
